5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, let's find that werewolf quickly. I'm not letting anyone get hurt!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,"Let's keep a cool head, Takumi. Rushing leads to mistakes.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! Let's all do our best and work together to save the village!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with George. We should observe each other carefully first.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Rin,,This is like a real adventure! I'm gonna find the bad guy first!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@George, being ""cool"" is fine, but we can't just sit around. We need a plan.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"A plan requires information. Right now, we have none.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,Maybe we can talk about our first impressions? I think everyone seems so nice!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,Impressions can be deceiving. That's the point of this game.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Rin,,I bet the werewolf is someone who talks too much! Or maybe someone who doesn't talk at all!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, that doesn't help anyone. We need to be logical.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,Logic is a good start. Let's see who contradicts themselves as the days go by.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'll trust you guys! Let's just try to be honest with each other, okay?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"Honesty is a luxury in this game, Yumi.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, you're being a grumpy big brother! I'm just thinking out loud!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm not a big brother! I'm just focused. Let's get this over with.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I will continue to observe. I believe we can find the truth.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm excited to see how this goes! Good luck to us all!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll be watching. Let's see what happens tomorrow.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready for tomorrow! I'm gonna be the hero of the village!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
