32,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I've got a feeling about some of you. Let's start narrowing it down.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,George,,It's only the first day. Let's not jump to conclusions without evidence.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Good morning! I hope everyone slept well! Does anyone have any clues?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Clues are rare this early. Unless the Seer wants to speak up.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Rin,,I had a dream! But I forgot it already. Oops!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, if the Seer speaks too early, the werewolf will just kill them.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,George,,Exactly. It's better to wait and see who is trying to lead the vote.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Yumi,,That's true! We have to protect the Seer. They're our best hope!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Misaki,,True. But silence can also be a mask for the werewolf.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Misaki, you're always so serious! Maybe the werewolf is just hiding in plain sight!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm not afraid of the werewolf. I'll do whatever it takes to protect you guys.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,George,,"Your enthusiasm is admirable, Takumi, but let's remain cautious.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"You're so brave, Takumi-kun! I feel safe with you around!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Misaki,,Safety is an illusion here. We should look at the voting patterns.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Rin,,I want to vote for someone! It's like a game of hide and seek!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, stop treating this like a game. We need to be serious.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,George,,"I've noticed Rin is quite restless. It could be nothing, or it could be a tell.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Oh, Rin-chan is just energetic! I think she's just excited!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Misaki,,Energy can be a distraction. Let's consider the options carefully.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm not a distraction! I'm just Rin! I'm voting for someone who looks suspicious!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
