65,2,1,talk,George,,Takumi is gone. That's a loss for the village. We must be more careful.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Yumi,,Oh no! Takumi-kun! I can't believe it! Who would do such a thing?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The werewolf. And they chose a target who was actively trying to lead.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,George,,"Rin was executed, but the werewolf is still among us. We are now only four.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Yumi,,This is so scary... I just want us all to be friends! Who do you think it is?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@George, you were the one who first pointed out Rin's restlessness.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,George,,I merely observed. It was a collective decision.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Yumi,,I just followed along because I thought Rin-chan was acting a bit weird... I'm sorry!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Misaki,,Apologies don't find the werewolf. We need to identify the Possessed as well.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
